":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1523501010:0":{"text":"落ち着け、いったいどうしたというのだ？","source_cn":"不要慌慌张张的。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB83F4BD0C1BA3B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1523501011:0":{"text":"あ……アウレリン議事官です。彼が城外で兵を集め、<style=\"highlight\">今すぐ領主の座を明け渡さねば</style>、武力行使も辞さないと迫ってきています。","source_cn":"是……奥勒留议事官。他在城外聚集士兵，扬言要用武力强攻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2016F3655A9BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1523501012:0":{"text":"隊長はすでに衛兵を率いて城門へ向かいましたが……相手の数があまりに多く、長くは持ちこたえられそうもありません！","source_cn":"队长已经带着卫队到了城门，但对面人数太多，恐怕……恐怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478117BCAD38610F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523501013:0":{"text":"アウレリン……またあいつか！","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1523501013":{"text":"アウレリン……またあいつか！","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal